  "rationale": "In the batch, prefixes ending in “A day with” continue with a proper name (Tom, Ben, or Mia), but the representative prefix strongly favors the determiner “a”; the weight-only update barely changes that error. Add a shared structural pattern to the available proper-name output roots, rather than conditioning on a particular observed name or introducing a head for information already visible in the prefix. This is deliberately limited to the observed opening frame. Other continuations after “with,” names outside the declared vocabulary, and other opening frames remain possible; the batch and replay gate must determine whether this provisional repair is retained.",
